From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msado15: a connection starts with no data source (6033)

6032 gave the connection object the data source it keeps while open,
but Connection_create (malloc) did not set it: a connection released
without a successful Open uninitialized whatever the memory held and
crashed (msado15:msado15 stopped in its first connection test).
---
diff --git a/dlls/msado15/connection.c b/dlls/msado15/connection.c
index d98e005..d396699 100644
--- a/dlls/msado15/connection.c
+++ b/dlls/msado15/connection.c
@@ -1464,6 +1464,9 @@ HRESULT Connection_create( void **obj )
     connection->mode = adModeUnknown;
     connection->location = adUseServer;
     connection->session = NULL;
+#ifndef SG_MUTANT_ADO_DSO_UNSET
+    connection->dso = NULL;
+#endif
     connection->errors = NULL;
     connection->props = NULL;
 
